  "reviewBasis": [
    "Read complete Linux acquisition/runner/sdist source; root immutable PBS API original SHA/tag/asset digest/size are checked before download/extraction.",
    "Archive extraction confines members/link targets to Python root and uses data filter; actual interpreter version/implementation and executable SHA are recorded. No global install or PATH change.",
    "Fresh venv installation invokes exact artifact offline without runtime dependencies; the collector independently enforces repository-external cwd, installed wheel43file/METADATA match, -I, empty PATH and absent overrides.",
    "candidatePython keeps venv/bin/python identity and does not resolve its symlink to the base interpreter.",
    "Actual argv/cwd/Popen PID/environment policy/stdout/stderr/exit and original observation bytes are preserved; failed process output is retained rather than synthesized as success.",
    "Linux representative sdist builds with fixed offline3dependencies into a real wheel then installs/observes it; source archive and derived wheel identities are kept separate.",
    "Independently recomputed V validate_cell for all four final Linux wheel raw receipts, each six cases+metadata+real running cancellation PASS. No new platform computation or full suite run."
  ],
